                                "example_id": "ab1f59d9-e79c-4a18-9447-069e6a30eff8",
                                "sense_id": "5adb7b89-5dd4-3739-993a-a8e71b67aa67",
                                "text": "И, наверное, он считал ещё себя богоборцем и Прометеем, когда сочинял эту выспреннюю галиматью, переполненную пьяными выкриками и выпадами против человека и человечности."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9544bfa5-1ca6-379c-b070-015864d465d8",
                        "entry_id": "779bb1ba-71ad-3a01-a027-0c3f855257e4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., высок. высочайший, наивысший, может иметь негативный смысл"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dd19e53-1174-497f-b5d3-76b0a6201d8d",
                                "sense_id": "9544bfa5-1ca6-379c-b070-015864d465d8",
                                "text": "И будет в тот день: посетит Господь воинство выспреннее на высоте и царей земных на земле. И будут собраны вместе, как узники, в ров, и будут заключены в темницу, и после многих дней будут наказаны."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05d97545-c4b8-4641-a35a-5f78c865efc3",
                        "source_entry_id": "779bb1ba-71ad-3a01-a027-0c3f855257e4",
                        "source_sense_description": "возвышенный",
                        "target_lang_word": "lofty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lofty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1439d85-744e-3d1e-8db9-8f73f362508f",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b590b0-5b1a-37ae-b840-21b008205801",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "High, tall, having great height or stature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c628861d-b372-450c-9d14-9cf3f5e030e9",
                                                "sense_id": "a1439d85-744e-3d1e-8db9-8f73f362508f",
                                                "text": "The lofty mountains roſe faint to the ſight and loſt their foreheads in the diſtant ſkies: the little hills, cloathed in darker green and ſkirted with embroidered vales, diſcovered the ſecret haunts of kids and bounding roes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0cb4be0-be3c-4a01-84b0-166c27601cee",
                                                "sense_id": "a1439d85-744e-3d1e-8db9-8f73f362508f",
                                                "text": "On my left was a river, which came roaring down from a range of lofty mountains right before me to the south-east."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0248ea9e-6382-4d78-87d3-037b257ec7da",
                                                "sense_id": "a1439d85-744e-3d1e-8db9-8f73f362508f",
                                                "text": "When the night was half spent, I rose and walked on, till the day broke in all its beauty and the sun rose over the heads of the lofty hills and athwart the low gravelly plains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d9baa99-85a1-31d2-8529-2ea8ceac0aa1",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b590b0-5b1a-37ae-b840-21b008205801",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Idealistic, implying over-optimism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fecc2ea7-64a1-4df5-9218-61f7c8f505aa",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9baa99-85a1-31d2-8529-2ea8ceac0aa1",
                                                "text": "a lofty goal"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "488d91f0-91f9-4202-8b61-70d0bf566eed",
                                                "sense_id": "3d9baa99-85a1-31d2-8529-2ea8ceac0aa1",
                                                "text": "A goal from Steven Caulker, just after the hour mark, was enough to hand victory to Malky Mackay's men, with Swansea falling some way short of the lofty standards they have set previously at this level."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0db56f8d-8445-3190-9c01-2d7f582241a1",
                                        "entry_id": "d6b590b0-5b1a-37ae-b840-21b008205801",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extremely proud; arrogant; haughty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e796c07-13fb-4eae-bb46-4240215c5dae",
                                                "sense_id": "0db56f8d-8445-3190-9c01-2d7f582241a1",
                                                "text": "that lofty pity with which prosperous folk are apt to remember their grandfathers"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c8df76c-1564-4054-ad2e-9bb809ab6150",
                        "source_entry_id": "779bb1ba-71ad-3a01-a027-0c3f855257e4",
                        "source_sense_description": "возвышенный",
                        "target_lang_word": "high-flown",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "high-flown",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7dffee4-e76b-3d84-8dc3-087c8f876274",
                                        "entry_id": "a0d20c0a-f361-359e-87b3-c8a9d6045e0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "pretentiously eloquent; highly figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ee9cf0a-f7fe-4169-a54b-55989d2ca301",
                                                "sense_id": "c7dffee4-e76b-3d84-8dc3-087c8f876274",
                                                "text": "Red River Settlement is, to use a high-flown expression, an oasis in the desert, and may be likened to a spot upon the moon or a solitary ship upon the ocean. In plain English, it is an isolated settlement on the borders of one of the vast prairies of North America."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43fe76fc-6c62-331b-9f3c-6130f6c517d5",
                                        "entry_id": "a0d20c0a-f361-359e-87b3-c8a9d6045e0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "lofty, extravagant, refined"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55a4e2b1-244b-4272-940d-413258307639",
                                                "sense_id": "43fe76fc-6c62-331b-9f3c-6130f6c517d5",
                                                "text": "It seems to me he makes troubles, by expecting every one else to be as quixotic as himself. He is not likely to find high-flown notions among ordinary business men!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ec6551b-bb61-4392-8d0e-a83b0b1ed990",
                        "source_entry_id": "779bb1ba-71ad-3a01-a027-0c3f855257e4",
                        "source_sense_description": "возвышенный",
                        "target_lang_word": "bombastic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bombastic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ae47598-9736-3ae9-88e5-0349e74fd43b",
                                        "entry_id": "7fa61e27-b79f-3dfe-9442-1e17303c4a98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "showy in speech and given to using flowery or elaborate terms; grandiloquent; pompous"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a355c53-db8e-4358-a6d5-961478e69d11",
                                                "sense_id": "2ae47598-9736-3ae9-88e5-0349e74fd43b",
                                                "text": "Dorsett came up the stairs, buggy whip in hand. He bustled into the office in his usual self-important way. Frank noticed that the old clerk sat down on him promptly. He was not one bit impressed with the bombastic visitor from Greenville."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a0f1f76-9061-3234-a5f1-962d3dc8be71",
                                        "entry_id": "7fa61e27-b79f-3dfe-9442-1e17303c4a98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "High-sounding but with little meaning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eee3b2d-04ba-34a8-8b32-116b9a1a0da2",
                                        "entry_id": "7fa61e27-b79f-3dfe-9442-1e17303c4a98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inflated, overfilled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
